  { category: 'Science', text: 'A good scientist is a person with original ideas. A good engineer is a person who makes a design that works with as few original ideas as possible.', author: 'Freeman Dyson' },
  { category: 'Science', text: 'There are no such things as applied sciences, only applications of science.', author: 'Louis Pasteur' },

