  { category: 'Philosophy', text: 'In adversity, it is easy to despise life; truly brave is the man who can endure to be miserable.', author: 'Seneca' },
  { category: 'Philosophy', text: 'True happiness is to enjoy the present, without anxious dependence upon the future.', author: 'Seneca' },
  { category: 'Philosophy', text: 'We are more often frightened than hurt; and we suffer more in imagination than in reality.', author: 'Seneca' },

  // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // DEEP WORK & PRODUCTIVITY  (~75 quotes)
  // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Human beings, it seems, are at their best when immersed deeply in something challenging.', author: 'Cal Newport' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'A deep life is a good life.', author: 'Cal Newport' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Clarity about what matters provides clarity about what does not.', author: 'Cal Newport' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Flow is the state in which people are so involved in an activity that nothing else seems to matter.', author: 'Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The best moments usually occur when a person\'s body or mind is stretched to its limits.', author: 'Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Creativity is a central source of meaning in our lives.', author: 'Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The scariest moment is always just before you start.', author: 'Stephen King' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Amateurs sit and wait for inspiration. The rest of us just get up and go to work.', author: 'Stephen King' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'It\'s not the daily increase but daily decrease. Hack away at the unessential.', author: 'Bruce Lee' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication.', author: 'Leonardo da Vinci' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'I have not failed. I\'ve just found 10,000 ways that won\'t work.', author: 'Thomas Edison' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The secret of getting ahead is getting started.', author: 'Mark Twain' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Give me six hours to chop down a tree and I will spend the first four sharpening the axe.', author: 'Abraham Lincoln' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Concentrate all your thoughts upon the work at hand. The sun\'s rays do not burn until brought to a focus.', author: 'Alexander Graham Bell' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'You do not rise to the level of your goals. You fall to the level of your systems.', author: 'James Clear' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Every action you take is a vote for the type of person you wish to become.', author: 'James Clear' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The most dangerous distractions are the ones you love, but that don\'t love you back.', author: 'Warren Buffett' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Focus is a matter of deciding what things you\'re not going to do.', author: 'John Carmack' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Done is better than perfect.', author: 'Sheryl Sandberg' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Plans are useless but planning is indispensable.', author: 'Dwight D. Eisenhower' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Strategy without tactics is the slowest route to victory. Tactics without strategy is the noise before defeat.', author: 'Sun Tzu' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'He who sweats more in training bleeds less in war.', author: 'Spartan Warrior Code' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Whether you think you can or you think you can\'t, you\'re right.', author: 'Henry Ford' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Genius is one percent inspiration and ninety-nine percent perspiration.', author: 'Thomas Edison' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The successful warrior is the average man, with laser-like focus.', author: 'Bruce Lee' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Be like water making its way through cracks. Water is fluid, soft, and yielding — but water will wear away rock.', author: 'Bruce Lee' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'I fear not the man who has practiced 10,000 kicks once, but I fear the man who has practiced one kick 10,000 times.', author: 'Bruce Lee' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The key is not to prioritize what\'s on your schedule, but to schedule your priorities.', author: 'Stephen Covey' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Most of what we say and do is not essential. If you can eliminate it, you\'ll have more time.', author: 'Marcus Aurelius' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Work while they sleep. Learn while they party. Save while they spend. Live like they dream.', author: 'Grant Cardone' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Opportunities don\'t happen. You create them.', author: 'Chris Grosser' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Don\'t watch the clock; do what it does. Keep going.', author: 'Sam Levenson' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'It always seems impossible until it\'s done.', author: 'Nelson Mandela' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Success is the sum of small efforts — repeated day in and day out.', author: 'Robert Collier' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The difference between ordinary and extraordinary is that little extra.', author: 'Jimmy Johnson' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Hard work beats talent when talent doesn\'t work hard.', author: 'Tim Notke' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'You\'ll never plough a field by turning it over in your mind.', author: 'Irish Proverb' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Action is the foundational key to all success.', author: 'Pablo Picasso' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The road to success and the road to failure are almost exactly the same.', author: 'Colin R. Davis' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'If you spend too much time thinking about a thing, you\'ll never get it done.', author: 'Bruce Lee' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Start where you are. Use what you have. Do what you can.', author: 'Arthur Ashe' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The only way to do great work is to love what you do.', author: 'Steve Jobs' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Stay hungry. Stay foolish.', author: 'Steve Jobs' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Your time is limited, so don\'t waste it living someone else\'s life.', author: 'Steve Jobs' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Innovation distinguishes between a leader and a follower.', author: 'Steve Jobs' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Great things are done by a series of small things brought together.', author: 'Vincent Van Gogh' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Motivation is what gets you started. Habit is what keeps you going.', author: 'Jim Ryun' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'There are no shortcuts to any place worth going.', author: 'Beverly Sills' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The expert in anything was once a beginner.', author: 'Helen Hayes' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Small deeds done are better than great deeds planned.', author: 'Peter Marshall' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing.', author: 'Walt Disney' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'All our dreams can come true, if we have the courage to pursue them.', author: 'Walt Disney' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'First, solve the problem. Then, write the code.', author: 'John Johnson' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The best time to plant a tree was 20 years ago. The second best time is now.', author: 'Chinese Proverb' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Don\'t find fault, find a remedy.', author: 'Henry Ford' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'When everything seems to be going against you, remember that the airplane takes off against the wind, not with it.', author: 'Henry Ford' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Quality means doing it right when no one is looking.', author: 'Henry Ford' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Do the difficult things while they are easy and do the great things while they are small.', author: 'Lao Tzu' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.', author: 'Lao Tzu' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'He who knows others is wise; he who knows himself is enlightened.', author: 'Lao Tzu' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The more you know, the more you realize you know nothing.', author: 'Socrates' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Think twice before you speak, because your words and influence will plant the seed of either success or failure.', author: 'Napoleon Hill' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The starting point of all achievement is desire.', author: 'Napoleon Hill' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Whatever the mind can conceive and believe, it can achieve.', author: 'Napoleon Hill' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Definiteness of purpose is the starting point of all achievement.', author: 'W. Clement Stone' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Learning never exhausts the mind.', author: 'Leonardo da Vinci' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'It had long since come to my attention that people of accomplishment rarely sat back and let things happen to them.', author: 'Leonardo da Vinci' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Simplicity is the keynote of all true elegance.', author: 'Coco Chanel' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The person who reads too little and works too much lacks both knowledge and wisdom.', author: 'Theodore Roosevelt' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Believe you can and you\'re halfway there.', author: 'Theodore Roosevelt' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Do what you can, with what you have, where you are.', author: 'Theodore Roosevelt' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The only man who never makes a mistake is the man who never does anything.', author: 'Theodore Roosevelt' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Comparison is the thief of joy.', author: 'Theodore Roosevelt' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'Nothing is particularly hard if you divide it into small jobs.', author: 'Henry Ford' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The secret of change is to focus all of your energy not on fighting the old, but on building the new.', author: 'Socrates' },
  { category: 'Deep Work', text: 'The mind is not a vessel to be filled but a fire to be ignited.', author: 'Plutarch' },
];
---

<section class="daily-quote-section px-4 py-12" aria-labelledby="daily-quote-title">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto rounded-[1.5rem] border border-border bg-card/80 p-6 md:p-8 text-center shadow-lg shadow-black/5">
    <p class="section-kicker">A thought for today</p>
    <h2 id="daily-quote-title" class="mt-3 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Daily quote</h2>
    <blockquote class="mt-5" id="quoteBlock" style="transition: opacity 0.4s ease;">
      <p id="dailyQuoteText" class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">Loading today's thought…</p>
      <footer id="dailyQuoteAuthor" class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted"></footer>
    </blockquote>
    <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <span id="dailyQuoteCategory" class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-primary/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary"></span>
      <button
        id="newQuoteBtn"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Show a different quote"
        title="New quote (press Q)"
        style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.35rem; padding:0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius:9999px; border:1px solid var(--border,#cfd8ea); background:transparent; font-size:0.75rem; cursor:pointer; color:var(--muted,#666); transition:color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;"
      >
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
        New quote
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script define:vars={{ quotesJson: JSON.stringify(quotes) }}>
  const quotes = JSON.parse(quotesJson);

  function pickRandom(exclude) {
    let idx;
    do { idx = Math.floor(Math.random() * quotes.length); } while (quotes.length > 1 && idx === exclude);
    return idx;
  }

  function showQuote(idx, animate) {
    const block = document.getElementById('quoteBlock');
    const textEl = document.getElementById('dailyQuoteText');
    const authorEl = document.getElementById('dailyQuoteAuthor');
    const catEl = document.getElementById('dailyQuoteCategory');
    const q = quotes[idx];

    if (animate) {
      block.style.opacity = '0';
      setTimeout(() => {
        textEl.textContent = `\u201c${q.text}\u201d`;
        authorEl.textContent = `\u2014 ${q.author}`;
        catEl.textContent = q.category;
        block.style.opacity = '1';
      }, 200);
    } else {
      textEl.textContent = `\u201c${q.text}\u201d`;
      authorEl.textContent = `\u2014 ${q.author}`;
      catEl.textContent = q.category;
    }
    return idx;
  }

  let currentIdx = pickRandom(-1);
  showQuote(currentIdx, false);

  const btn = document.getElementById('newQuoteBtn');
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    currentIdx = pickRandom(currentIdx);
    showQuote(currentIdx, true);
  });

  // Press Q anywhere on the page for a new quote
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'q' || e.key === 'Q') {
      if (['INPUT', 'TEXTAREA', 'SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName)) return;
      currentIdx = pickRandom(currentIdx);
      showQuote(currentIdx, true);
    }
  });
</script>
